	[m1]Fürst 142ᵃ; vgl. בולרין u. Exc. No 10, 12, 13. \[Jastrow conj. [i]μῖμος[/i]. Lies: ܡܝܡܐܕܣ [i]μιμάδες[/i] mimae, Brockelm. 188, actress, prostitute.\][/m]

